sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant SupaAuth as Supabase Auth Service
    participant EdgeGW as Edge API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    User->>SupaAuth: POST /auth/v1/signup (email, password)
    SupaAuth->>DB: INSERT INTO auth.users (Argon2 Hash)
    DB->>DB: Trigger `on_auth_user_created`
    DB->>DB: INSERT INTO profiles (id, full_name, language)
    SupaAuth-->>User: 200 OK (RS256 Access Token + Refresh Token)

    User->>EdgeGW: GET /api/v1/profile (Bearer <access_token>)
    EdgeGW->>EdgeGW: Verify JWT Signature (sub = auth.uid())
    EdgeGW->>DB: SELECT * FROM profiles WHERE id = auth.uid()
    DB-->>EdgeGW: Profile Row
    EdgeGW-->>User: 200 OK ({ data: profile })
